-- ── hand-written: grants and row-level security ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
-- What a credit note has been set against is written only by the functions below: the app's
-- role reads it and nothing more. A row is read where both the credit note and the invoice it
-- settles are read: not another branch's invoice, and not the opening balances by a member
-- limited to some branches. (A salesperson reads what their credit notes settled through
-- app.credit_note_settled, which hides a colleague's invoice.)
GRANT SELECT ON public.credit_note_allocations TO app_runtime;
